zone.description:
This thermostat is the main source of a zone.

Master thermostat: {master}
Additional source: {source}
Split rule: {rule}

zone_heating_types.description:
Source 1: {source_1}
Source 2: {source_2}

The zone needs the heating type of both sources, and a source here sets none in its own entry. The type is written to that source's entry when you save.

zone_sources.description:
Master thermostat: {master}

Source 1: {source_1} ({source_1_type})
Source 2: {source_2} ({source_2_type})

The main source's SmartPI regulates the zone; the other source follows the split rule from one common model of the zone. Heating types come from each thermostat's own entry (or the previous step).

{recommendation}

